  "details": "The message in VRC+ Pride Event (2026) tab is not consistent with external messaging, which seems unintended. It confuses the user if the Pride Button will be rewarded for everyone at $100,000 donated campaign goal, or only for those who gifted VRC+ during the campaign, should the goal be reached.\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/games/vrchat/announcements/detail/668366713382767847\n\n> And at the end of the month, anyone who gifted VRC+ during Pride will unlock the Pride Button Accessory!\n\nhttps://youtu.be/oKMOUy-U01g?t=27\n\n> And at the end of the month, anyone who gifted VRChat+ [sic!] during Pride will unlock the Pride Button Accessory!\n\nVRC+ tab:\n\n> Community Spirit Reward\n\n> Unlock an accessory for everyone if we reach our community goal.",
